{
  "file_id": "3621",
  "text_count": 94,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "Someone else is there, too!",
      "_offset": 1640,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "Yo, man, that's the biggest one\nI've seen so far! Go get him,\nArresterdramon!",
      "_offset": 1668,
      "_length": 77,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "Grooooooooh!",
      "_offset": 1746,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "...Too inexperienced!",
      "_offset": 1759,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Aaaaaaagh!",
      "_offset": 1781,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "Arresterdramon!",
      "_offset": 1792,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "There you are, Gankuumon!",
      "_offset": 1808,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "Not again!",
      "_offset": 1838,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "He's gone...",
      "_offset": 1849,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Man, he got away...",
      "_offset": 1862,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Sorry, Tagiru!",
      "_offset": 1882,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "No sweat, no sweat. We'll just\nhave to look for him again.",
      "_offset": 1897,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "By the way, would you happen to be\nTaiki's friend?",
      "_offset": 1956,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Taiki? Aaaaah! Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 2007,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "Ack!",
      "_offset": 2041,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Whoopsie-daisy! I *totally* forgot\nabout Taiki!",
      "_offset": 2046,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "We gotta go back, Arresterdramon!",
      "_offset": 2094,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "But, Tagiru... what about these\nguys...",
      "_offset": 2128,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "Oops, forgot about them! Hey, why\ndon't you come with us?",
      "_offset": 2168,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "O-Okay!",
      "_offset": 2226,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "I'm Tagiru Akashi, and this is\nArresterdramon.",
      "_offset": 2234,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Nice to meet you, Tai and\nAgumon!",
      "_offset": 2281,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Nice to meet you!",
      "_offset": 2318,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "Nice to meet you!",
      "_offset": 2336,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "I'm Taiki's junior, and a Digimon\nHunter!",
      "_offset": 2354,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "What?!",
      "_offset": 2396,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "A Digimon... Hunter?!",
      "_offset": 2403,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "Oh! No worries, no worries! We\ndon't take other people's Digimon!",
      "_offset": 2425,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "...R-Right! Thank goodness!",
      "_offset": 2491,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "There's a fake, right there!",
      "_offset": 2523,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "Right on... just like they said.\nLooks just like Arresterdramon!",
      "_offset": 2552,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "Let's go, guys!",
      "_offset": 2617,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "We did it, Tagiru!",
      "_offset": 2633,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "Great job as always,\nArresterdramon!",
      "_offset": 2652,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "You did great, Agumon!",
      "_offset": 2689,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "Well, it wasn't easy...",
      "_offset": 2712,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "So Tai can go home, right?",
      "_offset": 2736,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "You've finally arrived, chosen\nones...",
      "_offset": 2772,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "Gankuumon!",
      "_offset": 2811,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "I'm gonna get revenge for Hackmon!",
      "_offset": 2822,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "And we're gonna getcha this time!",
      "_offset": 2857,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "Get ready!",
      "_offset": 2891,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Ngh... ghhhh...",
      "_offset": 2906,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "Hackmon!",
      "_offset": 2922,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Tai... Agumon...",
      "_offset": 2931,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "So you've finally recovered...\nHave you finally trained properly?",
      "_offset": 2951,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "And you didn't let a silly little\npunch get you down either, did\nyou?",
      "_offset": 3017,
      "_length": 69,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Hahahahaha!",
      "_offset": 3087,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "Hahahahaha!",
      "_offset": 3099,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "...Why are you two so friendly all\nof a sudden?",
      "_offset": 3114,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "Oh, Gankuumon's like my guardian\nof sorts.",
      "_offset": 3162,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "What?!",
      "_offset": 3205,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "So then why were you attacking\nGankuumon earlier?",
      "_offset": 3212,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "Oh, I always do that. It's like\nour daily ritual.",
      "_offset": 3262,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "'Cause if I don't, he's gonna get\n*me* instead.",
      "_offset": 3312,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "Exactly.",
      "_offset": 3360,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "What? You really seemed like you\nhated each other, I thought you\nwere mortal enemies!",
      "_offset": 3369,
      "_length": 85,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "Hey, hey, but then what are you?\nYou're clearly not normal.",
      "_offset": 3455,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "Gankuumon is one of the Royal\nKnights who protects the order of\nthe Digital World!",
      "_offset": 3515,
      "_length": 82,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "The Royal Knights?!",
      "_offset": 3598,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "And someday I'll be as strong as\nhim, you just wait!",
      "_offset": 3618,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "So then why are *we* trapped in\nhere?",
      "_offset": 3671,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "We need you to correct the\ndistortions in the digital fields.",
      "_offset": 3709,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "Something with great power has\nforced itself into this space and\nhastened its collapse.",
      "_offset": 3771,
      "_length": 87,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "You have defeated numerous\nenemies, and you have finally\nreached this place.",
      "_offset": 3859,
      "_length": 76,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "So then what are the distortions?",
      "_offset": 3936,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "In this place, distorted fragments\nin the Digital World are\ngathering...",
      "_offset": 3970,
      "_length": 72,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "It has copied the appearance of\nyour Digimon and, without any\nconscience, continued to grow.",
      "_offset": 4043,
      "_length": 92,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "So if we don't do anything about\nall the fake Digimon...",
      "_offset": 4136,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "The copies will continue to\npermeate through things and gain\npower.",
      "_offset": 4193,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "If they were to overflow from this\nspace, they would completely cover\nthe Digital Field.",
      "_offset": 4261,
      "_length": 88,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "No way...",
      "_offset": 4350,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "And if that happens, it'll have\nbad effects on our world, too.",
      "_offset": 4360,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "There is not much time left before\nthis space collapses.",
      "_offset": 4423,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "I have opened the door to the\nspatial core that controls this\nspace. Now go, chosen ones.",
      "_offset": 4480,
      "_length": 89,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "I shall stave off the collapse of\nthis space in the meantime.",
      "_offset": 4570,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "Hackmon, come here!",
      "_offset": 4632,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "Gankuumon...",
      "_offset": 4652,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "You are still immature, but your\npotential exceeds even mine.",
      "_offset": 4665,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "I-It does?!",
      "_offset": 4727,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "You'll lead the chosen ones to the \nspatial core, where you will fix \nthe source that has gone haywire.",
      "_offset": 4739,
      "_length": 103,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "I will!",
      "_offset": 4843,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "Tai!",
      "_offset": 4851,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "Yeah, there's no way we're gonna\nrun away from this!",
      "_offset": 4859,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "We'll go with you, too!",
      "_offset": 4912,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "Yeah, let us join in!",
      "_offset": 4936,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "Let's go, guys!",
      "_offset": 4958,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "I've reached my limits in my\ntraining as a Digimon Hunter. I'll\nshow you a real Hunt next time!",
      "_offset": 4974,
      "_length": 95,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "And in order to make that happen,\nwe'll save the digital field!\nLet's go!",
      "_offset": 5070,
      "_length": 73,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "It'll be fine, Tai!",
      "_offset": 5144,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "Of course! We'll always find a\nway!",
      "_offset": 5167,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "【Area 1】",
      "_offset": 5203,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "【Area 2】",
      "_offset": 5226,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "【Area 3】",
      "_offset": 5249,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    }
  ]
}